{
"recipe_id":"10 Moussaka with Potato and Eggplant",
"source_text":"Moussaka - Recipe 1\n\n做法整理\n大蒜，洋葱在热油中炒软，下羊肉碎，翻炒，加番茄罐头和新鲜番茄炒软，加入黑胡椒和盐调味后，入高汤和肉桂煮20分钟到汤汁收干，最后拌入薄荷碎即可。但其实就和红酱做法差不多吧><||所以就可以直接拿红酱来加入肉桂和薄荷煮入味也可以~~\n土豆和茄子切厚片，平底锅煎到8分熟，待用。\n黄油入热锅融化后加入一勺面粉，快速拌匀，慢慢加入牛奶，每次确定面粉吸收牛奶后再下入下一部分牛奶，全程小火，不停搅拌，直到像蛋黄酱一样成糊状。放在一旁作为白酱备用。\n在白酱中加入切成小块的山羊奶酪，搅拌直到全部融入。\n白酱离火加盖放至稍凉，加入打匀的鸡蛋，搅拌均匀。一定要放凉，否则鸡蛋会烫熟。\n烤箱预热200度。然后来组合~烤碗中先擦一层油防粘，底部铺一层土豆片，再抹上一层肉酱，再铺一层茄子片，再摸一层肉酱，再一层土豆片，保证每层都均匀平整。然后就可以倒上所有的蛋奶白酱，抹平。\n放入预热好的烤箱，200度30-40分钟。烤到表面上色。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "大蒜，洋葱在热油中炒软", "text_en": "Fry the garlic and onion in hot oil until soft.", "start_char": 25, "end_char": 36, "node_indices": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5], "edge_indices": [1, 2, 3, 4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 1, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 2, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 2, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 3, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "下羊肉碎", "text_en": "Add the minced lamb.", "start_char": 37, "end_char": 41, "node_indices": [6, 5], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 5, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "翻炒", "text_en": "Stir-fry the lamb.", "start_char": 42, "end_char": 44, "node_indices": [5, 7], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 6, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "加番茄罐头", "text_en": "Add the canned tomatoes.", "start_char": 45, "end_char": 50, "node_indices": [8, 7], "edge_indices": [7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 7, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 7, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "加番茄罐头和新鲜番茄", "text_en": "Add fresh tomatoes along with the canned tomatoes.", "start_char": 45, "end_char": 55, "node_indices": [9, 7], "edge_indices": [8], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "炒软", "text_en": "Fry until the tomatoes soften.", "start_char": 55, "end_char": 57, "node_indices": [7, 10], "edge_indices": [9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 9, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 9, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "加入黑胡椒和盐调味后", "text_en": "Add black pepper to season the sauce.", "start_char": 58, "end_char": 68, "node_indices": [11, 10], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 10, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "加入黑胡椒和盐调味后", "text_en": "Add salt to season the sauce.", "start_char": 58, "end_char": 68, "node_indices": [12, 10], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 11, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "入高汤", "text_en": "Add the stock.", "start_char": 69, "end_char": 72, "node_indices": [13, 10], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 12, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "入高汤和肉桂", "text_en": "Add cinnamon along with the stock.", "start_char": 69, "end_char": 75, "node_indices": [14, 10], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "煮20分钟到汤汁收干", "text_en": "Simmer for 20 minutes until the liquid has reduced.", "start_char": 75, "end_char": 85, "node_indices": [10, 51, 15], "edge_indices": [14, 15], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 14, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 51, "edge_index": 14, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 51, "edge_index": 15, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 15, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "最后拌入薄荷碎即可", "text_en": "Finally, add the chopped mint.", "start_char": 86, "end_char": 95, "node_indices": [16, 15], "edge_indices": [16], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 16, "edge_index": 16, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 16, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S013", "text": "最后拌入薄荷碎即可", "text_en": "Finally, stir in the chopped mint.", "start_char": 86, "end_char": 95, "node_indices": [15, 17], "edge_indices": [17], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 17, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 17, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S014", "text": "土豆和茄子切厚片", "text_en": "Cut the potatoes into thick slices.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 148, "node_indices": [18, 19], "edge_indices": [18], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 18, "edge_index": 18, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 18, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S015", "text": "土豆和茄子切厚片", "text_en": "Cut the eggplants into thick slices.", "start_char": 140, "end_char": 148, "node_indices": [20, 21], "edge_indices": [19], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 20, "edge_index": 19, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 19, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S016", "text": "平底锅煎到8分熟", "text_en": "Pan-fry the potato slices until about 80% cooked.", "start_char": 149, "end_char": 157, "node_indices": [19, 22, 23], "edge_indices": [20, 21], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 19, "edge_index": 20, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 20, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 22, "edge_index": 21, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 21, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S017", "text": "平底锅煎到8分熟", "text_en": "Pan-fry the eggplant slices until about 80% cooked.", "start_char": 149, "end_char": 157, "node_indices": [21, 24, 25], "edge_indices": [22, 23], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 21, "edge_index": 22, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 22, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 24, "edge_index": 23, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 23, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S018", "text": "黄油入热锅融化", "text_en": "Melt the butter in a hot pan.", "start_char": 162, "end_char": 169, "node_indices": [26, 27, 28], "edge_indices": [24, 25], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 26, "edge_index": 24, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 27, "edge_index": 24, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 27, "edge_index": 25, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 25, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S019", "text": "加入一勺面粉", "text_en": "Add one spoonful of flour.", "start_char": 170, "end_char": 176, "node_indices": [29, 28], "edge_indices": [26], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 29, "edge_index": 26, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 26, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S020", "text": "快速拌匀", "text_en": "Stir together quickly.", "start_char": 177, "end_char": 181, "node_indices": [28, 30], "edge_indices": [27], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 28, "edge_index": 27, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 27, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S021", "text": "慢慢加入牛奶", "text_en": "Slowly add some milk.", "start_char": 182, "end_char": 188, "node_indices": [31, 30], "edge_indices": [28], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 31, "edge_index": 28, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 28, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S022", "text": "再下入下一部分牛奶", "text_en": "Add the next portion of milk after the flour absorbs the previous portion.", "start_char": 200, "end_char": 209, "node_indices": [32, 30], "edge_indices": [29], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 32, "edge_index": 29, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 29, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S023", "text": "不停搅拌，直到像蛋黄酱一样成糊状", "text_en": "Stir continuously over low heat until the mixture becomes a mayonnaise-like paste.", "start_char": 215, "end_char": 231, "node_indices": [30, 33], "edge_indices": [30], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 30, "edge_index": 30, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 33, "edge_index": 30, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S024", "text": "切成小块的山羊奶酪", "text_en": "Cut the goat cheese into small pieces.", "start_char": 250, "end_char": 259, "node_indices": [34, 35], "edge_indices": [31], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 34, "edge_index": 31, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 35, "edge_index": 31, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S025", "text": "在白酱中加入切成小块的山羊奶酪", "text_en": "Add the goat cheese cut into small pieces to the white sauce.", "start_char": 244, "end_char": 259, "node_indices": [35, 33], "edge_indices": [32], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 35, "edge_index": 32, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 33, "edge_index": 32, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S026", "text": "搅拌直到全部融入", "text_en": "Stir until all the cheese is incorporated.", "start_char": 260, "end_char": 268, "node_indices": [33, 36], "edge_indices": [33], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 33, "edge_index": 33, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 36, "edge_index": 33, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S027", "text": "白酱离火加盖放至稍凉", "text_en": "Remove the white sauce from the heat, cover it, and let it cool slightly.", "start_char": 270, "end_char": 280, "node_indices": [36, 37], "edge_indices": [34], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 36, "edge_index": 34, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 37, "edge_index": 34, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S028", "text": "打匀的鸡蛋", "text_en": "Beat the egg until evenly mixed.", "start_char": 283, "end_char": 288, "node_indices": [38, 39], "edge_indices": [35], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 38, "edge_index": 35, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 39, "edge_index": 35, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S029", "text": "加入打匀的鸡蛋", "text_en": "Add the beaten egg to the cooled white sauce.", "start_char": 281, "end_char": 288, "node_indices": [39, 37], "edge_indices": [36], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 39, "edge_index": 36, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 37, "edge_index": 36, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S030", "text": "搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir until evenly combined.", "start_char": 289, "end_char": 293, "node_indices": [37, 40], "edge_indices": [37], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 37, "edge_index": 37, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 40, "edge_index": 37, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S031", "text": "烤箱预热200度", "text_en": "Preheat the oven to 200 degrees.", "start_char": 309, "end_char": 317, "node_indices": [41, 42], "edge_indices": [38], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 41, "edge_index": 38, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 42, "edge_index": 38, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S032", "text": "擦一层油防粘", "text_en": "Coat the baking dish with a layer of oil to prevent sticking.", "start_char": 327, "end_char": 334, "node_indices": [43, 44], "edge_indices": [39], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 43, "edge_index": 39, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 44, "edge_index": 39, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S033", "text": "底部铺一层土豆片", "text_en": "Lay a layer of potato slices on the bottom.", "start_char": 335, "end_char": 343, "node_indices": [23, 45], "edge_indices": [41], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 23, "edge_index": 41, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 45, "edge_index": 41, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S034", "text": "再抹上一层肉酱", "text_en": "Spread a layer of meat sauce over the potatoes.", "start_char": 344, "end_char": 352, "node_indices": [17, 45], "edge_indices": [42], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 17, "edge_index": 42, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 45, "edge_index": 42, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S035", "text": "再铺一层茄子片", "text_en": "Lay down a layer of eggplant slices.", "start_char": 352, "end_char": 360, "node_indices": [25, 45], "edge_indices": [43], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 25, "edge_index": 43, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 45, "edge_index": 43, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S036", "text": "再摸一层肉酱", "text_en": "Spread another layer of meat sauce.", "start_char": 360, "end_char": 366, "node_indices": [46, 45], "edge_indices": [44], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 46, "edge_index": 44, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 45, "edge_index": 44, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S037", "text": "再一层土豆片", "text_en": "Add another layer of potato slices.", "start_char": 367, "end_char": 373, "node_indices": [47, 45], "edge_indices": [45], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 47, "edge_index": 45, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 45, "edge_index": 45, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S038", "text": "保证每层都均匀平整", "text_en": "Make sure every layer is even and flat.", "start_char": 373, "end_char": 383, "node_indices": [45, 48], "edge_indices": [46], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 45, "edge_index": 46, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 48, "edge_index": 46, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S039", "text": "倒上所有的蛋奶白酱", "text_en": "Pour all the egg-and-milk white sauce on top.", "start_char": 389, "end_char": 398, "node_indices": [40, 48], "edge_indices": [47], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 40, "edge_index": 47, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 48, "edge_index": 47, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S040", "text": "抹平", "text_en": "Smooth the top.", "start_char": 398, "end_char": 401, "node_indices": [48, 49], "edge_indices": [48], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 48, "edge_index": 48, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 49, "edge_index": 48, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S041", "text": "放入预热好的烤箱", "text_en": "Put the assembled dish into the preheated oven.", "start_char": 403, "end_char": 411, "node_indices": [49, 42], "edge_indices": [49], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 49, "edge_index": 49, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 42, "edge_index": 49, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S042", "text": "200度30-40分钟。烤到表面上色。", "text_en": "Bake at 200 degrees for 30–40 minutes, until the surface is browned.", "start_char": 412, "end_char": 431, "node_indices": [42, 50], "edge_indices": [50], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 42, "edge_index": 50, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 50, "edge_index": 50, "role": "output"}]}],
